  m_text: The goal of this application is to provide supplementary information for
    college students to learn more about the respiratory system. This is meant to
    be used to augment what is learned in tradition lectures and textbook readings.
    It is our hope that this application can provide a fun and engaging way for students
    to learn about the respiratory system. Thank you!
